	<EntityComponents>
		<!--
			GENERATED by tools/New-PeerEscortPool.ps1 -Pool Land -Radius 1500 -WingAutopilot Tertiary -Slots 2 -OfferMinMs 1000 -OfferMaxMs 3000 -OfferChance 50. Do not edit by hand.
			Peer escorts for the Land pool: Units of this pool pair up with each other, never with another pool or a cruiser.
			Behavior: [TriggerGroups:GVK-Unit-All-TriggerGroup-PeerEscort-Land] and 2 [EscortOffsets:{X:.. Y:.. Z:..}] line(s).
			Needs an MES build with MeridiusIX/Modular-Encounters-Systems#386 (MatchReceiverEscort / MatchReceiverLeader) and #408 (LeaveEscortSlot).
			Booleans: GVK_Role_Escort (wing), GVK_Peer_Requesting (asked, no answer yet).
			Counters: GVK_Peer_SlotsUsed (slots in use; freed when a wing is lost), GVK_Peer_Wings (live wings; a leader with one never becomes a wing).
		-->
